      "side": 1,
      "message": "`hosts` is filtered to `retired\u003dFalse, broken\u003dFalse`, but `hosts_range` is not. A host that is now retired or broken still arrives here with its schedule, so `build_allocations` counts it in `host_count` and `_model_for_host` returns `unknown` for it even though the host record has a model. The previous-month half of the window makes this likely. Either fetch an unfiltered host list for the model lookup, or skip schedule rows whose host is not in `hosts`.",
      "revId": "2df9a36bbc54f3d9564b3baf4a1e8083d86170b0",
